00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:47.520
like in a different language.

00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:52.260
So imagine that the Node.js
backend is one of my services,

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:54.140
and on the other side,
on the client side,

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:55.740
I'll have a Python application.

