00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:38.880
So let's take a look
at the node code first.

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:40.470
It's very simple,
about 20 lines,

00:15:40.470 --> 00:15:42.990
and it's based on
Node.js Express.

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:47.200
So we have a few lines here
that define a rest API.

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:51.810
It's a post method for the
API that I've called echo.

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:56.400
It basically expects
