00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:31.690
I'm mentioning that to emphasize
the fact that with Endpoints

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:34.080
you will be able to use
any language that you want,

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:35.880
any framework that you want.

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:37.530
You're not limited
